0..67 Comment "//! `closed-after-move` closes a handle after it moves to a closer."
68..71 Comment "//!"
72..148 Comment "//! The send consumes the mover\'s slot. The checker reports `UsedAfterClose`"
149..173 Comment "//! at the second close."
